### Create new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Phat",
    "surname": "Do",
    "email": "dtphat.dev@gmail.com",
    "address": "Truong Thanh - Can Tho - Viet Nam",
    "alerting": false,
    "energyAlertingThreshold": 0
}

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/3

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Phat",
    "surname": "Do Tan",
    "email": "dtphat.dev@gmail.com",
    "address": "Truong Thanh - Can Tho - Viet Nam",
    "alerting": false,
    "energyAlertingThreshold": 0
}

### Delete user
DELETE  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user/2
